{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">打鼓嶺狗場有女子懷疑被狗咬死，據了解，涉事狗隻由狗義工轉交予狗場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事的持牌寵物酒店及犬隻訓練中心位於打鼓嶺坪洋新村。據了解，懷疑咬死女子的狗原本由停車場人士飼養，停車場結業後由狗義工接手，對方出錢寄養在狗酒店，正安排領養。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">根據狗的晶片顯示是混種唐狗。網上流傳圖片指，其實是混種比特鬥牛犬，屬本港禁止入口的格鬥狗品種，漁護署暫未確認。<br/><br/><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190430-%E6%89%93%E9%BC%93%E5%B6%BA%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%85%A8%E6%B8%AF%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%8929%E9%9A%BB%E6%A0%BC%E9%AC%A5%E7%8B%97%E6%8C%81%E7%89%8C%E5%8F%A3%E7%BD%A9%E7%8B%97%E5%B8%B6%E8%A6%8F%E5%AE%9A%E7%BD%B0%E5%89%87%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➤　延伸閱讀｜全港只有29隻格鬥狗持牌　口罩狗帶規定罰則一文看清</a><br/><br/><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190422-%E6%89%93%E9%BC%93%E5%B6%BA%E7%8B%97%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E7%B6%B2%E5%82%B3%E6%B6%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%94%90%E7%8B%97%E7%82%BA%E6%B7%B7%E7%A8%AE%E6%83%A1%E7%8A%AC%E5%9B%9B%E6%A0%BC%E9%AC%A5%E7%8B%97%E7%B4%94%E7%A8%AE%E6%B7%B7%E7%A8%AE%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97%E8%BC%B8%E6%B8%AF%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➤　打鼓嶺狗咬死人｜網傳涉事唐狗為混種惡犬　四格鬥狗純種混種不得輸港｜網絡熱話</a><br/><br/><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1190220-%E5%86%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%97%E7%84%A1%E7%B9%A9%E9%81%8A%E8%95%A9%E5%A4%96%E5%82%AD%E6%94%BE%E7%8B%97%E5%8F%AA%E9%A1%A7%E5%82%BE%E9%9B%BB%E8%A9%B1%E6%B3%95%E4%BE%8B%E8%A6%8F%E5%AE%9A%E5%85%AC%E7%9C%BE%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9%E9%A0%88%E7%94%A8%E5%B8%B6%E7%89%BD%E5%BC%95%E7%AD%89%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">➤　再有大狗無繩遊蕩　外傭放狗只顧傾電話　法例規定公眾地方須用帶牽引等｜網絡熱話</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T05:52:58.953029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}